85
00:04:41.013 --> 00:04:41.920
A few more things.

86
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.920
The US Maritime Administration
approved a one billion dollar offshore

87
00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:49.280
crude export port off
Louisiana, gCaptain reported.

88
00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.560
Its capacity wasn't given.

89
